====== MikroTik RBwAPG-5HacD2HnD (wAP ac) ======

Dual-band (2.4GHz/5GHz) dual-radio 802.11a/b/g/n/ac wireless access point with integrated antenna and two gigabit Ethernet ports, one supporting PoE-in, in a weatherproof enclosure. The SoC contains a powerful quad-core ARM CPU with hardware-accelerated encryption support.

The commercial name of the access point is //wAP ac//. Do not confuse this ipq40xx-based model with the older [[toh/mikrotik/wap_ac_rbwapg-5hact2hnd|ath79-based RBwAPG-5HacT2HnD]], also marketed as //wAP ac//.

